["x115l12","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["To go to the gym.","To clean their classroom.","To meet at the playground."],0,"下雨了，李老師說體育課改到體育館上，男生要大家快點去體育館。",{"au":"M: Hey everyone, cleaning time is over. Don't forget to put your cleaning tools back. It's raining now, so Mr. Lee says we'll have PE Class in the gym, not on the school playground. Hurry up.\nQuestion: What is the boy telling his class to do?","x":"115"}],
["x115l13","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["Today.","Next week.","When it plays on TV."],0,"男生下週很忙、也不想等到電視播，堅持今天看，女生最後也同意了。",{"au":"W: This is crazy. I don't want to wait in such a long line just to get tickets to a movie.\nM: I didn't expect so many people to be interested in this movie.\nW: Are you sure you want to see it today? Can we come some other time?\nM: Oh, please. I'll be super busy next week and won't have time, and I don't want to wait until it plays on TV. It'll be more exciting to see this movie on the big screen.\nW: All right, all right.\nM: I can wait. Why don't you go look around the area? I'll call you when I get the tickets.\nW: Good idea.\nQuestion: When do the man and woman decide to see the movie?","x":"115"}],
["x115l14","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["Use their time well.","Check their eye health.","Follow rules during a hospital visit."],1,"女生提醒大家很久沒檢查眼睛了，要大家安排時間去醫院檢查眼睛健康。",{"au":"W: Between your work, your friends, and family, life can be very busy. But it is time for you to stop and ask yourself this, \"When was the last time you had the doctor check your eyes?\" Millions of people in our country have common eye problems and don't even know it. Remember, your eyes are the windows to your health. Take time for yourself and plan a visit to the hospital. For more information, please visit www.nec.nch.gov\nQuestion: What does the woman want people to do?","x":"115"}],
["x115l15","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["They both did badly.","The boy did badly, but the girl did well.","The boy did well, but the girl did badly."],0,"男生不想談考試；女生說爸爸本來要買新手機，現在只能和手機說再見，還怕舊手機被沒收，可見兩人都考不好。",{"au":"W: Did you do well on the test yesterday?\nM: I don't want to talk about it. You did well, didn't you?\nW: Well, I...\nM: Oh, wait, no. Don't tell me. I don't want to feel worse about myself.\nW: Well, my dad said he would buy me a new cell phone if I got a good grade on the test. Now I can kiss that cell phone goodbye. Maybe I won't even be able to keep my old cell phone when he knows about my grade.\nM: Life is hard.\nW: Tests are harder.\nQuestion: How did the boy and the girl do on the test yesterday?","x":"115"}],
["x115l16","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["He misses it.","He feels excited about it.","He doesn't really enjoy it."],2,"大家都覺得大城市生活很刺激，男生卻說 it's not home，他想家，其實不太喜歡那裡的生活。",{"au":"W: Hey, I haven't seen you for a while.\nM: Yeah, I moved to Lake City for work. I just came back to see some friends.\nW: Lake City, huh? Life in the big city must be very exciting.\nM: Yeah, well...I guess you could say that. Most people think so.\nW: But you don't?\nM: Well, Lake City is different.\nW: Different?\nM: Yeah, it's not home.\nW: And you miss home.\nM: Yeah.\nQuestion: How does the man feel about his life in Lake City?","x":"115"}],
["x115l17","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["It gave very little food.","Its food and service were bad.","It allowed people to bring their pets."],1,"for the birds 是「很糟、沒價值」。薯條泡在油裡，老闆的狗跳上桌吃他的麵包也不處理，食物和服務都很差。",{"au":"W: Have you tried the new restaurant?\nM: Yeah, it's very popular, and I waited over an hour to get in.\nW: How did you like it?\nM: It was for the birds.\nW: Why do you say that?\nM: My French fries were actually swimming in oil, so I left most of them. And the restaurant owner didn't do anything after his dog jumped up on my table and had a bite of my bread.\nW: That's the most interesting dining experience I've heard.\nQuestion: Why does the man say the new restaurant was for the birds?","x":"115"}],
["x115l18","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["Nothing.","Start a fight with her.","Talk to her and ask her to stop."],0,"女生說有更重要的事要做，Rita 不是她的朋友，她的話傷不了自己，所以她什麼都不打算做。",{"au":"M: Rita has written a lot of things about you on the Internet. Did you know that?\nW: Yeah, I've read them, and they are not true.\nM: I know. What are you going to do? I'm on your side if you want to start a fight with her.\nW: Why should I? I have better things to do than thinking of ways to deal with her.\nM: Like what?\nW: Like cook a big meal for myself and play with my cat.\nM: Maybe you should at least talk to her and ask her to stop.\nW: Well, words only hurt when they come from someone I care about. Rita is not my friend.\nQuestion: What is the woman going to do to deal with Rita?","x":"115"}],
["x115l19","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["He will not read them.","He is studying too hard.","He knows how to enjoy his vacation."],0,"上次帶書也完全沒看，只看電影、玩手機，女生認為這次他也不會讀，所以叫他只帶一本。",{"au":"W: Luis, the trip is tomorrow. Have you packed everything you need?\nM: I've got almost everything ready, maybe one more pair of jeans and some books.\nW: Why are you bringing books with you? We're going abroad on a vacation.\nM: I'm thinking of reading on the plane. And when we're back in the hotel, I'll read too.\nW: You said the same thing last time, but you just watched movies on the plane, and in the hotel, you were too busy with your smartphone. The books you brought sat in your bag the whole time.\nM: I'll read this time.\nW: Then bring just one.\nQuestion: What does the woman think when the boy said he was bringing books on a vacation?","x":"115"}],
["x115l20","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["They will each ride their own bikes.","The girl will give the boy a ride on her bike.","The girl will ride a bike and the boy will walk."],1,"男生不會騎車、又不想走路，最後說偶爾把腳抬離地面也不錯，表示他要坐在妹妹的腳踏車後座。",{"au":"W: Let's go to the new ice cream shop.\nM: Yeah, but it's so hot today. I don't want to walk.\nW: I can ride my bike and you can sit on the back.\nM: What? But people will see. I'm your big brother.\nW: So, can you ride a bike?\nM: No, but your bike is small and my legs are too long.\nW: I'm sure you can keep your feet off the ground.\nM: But I'll look stupid.\nW: Or you could walk. It's only 15 minutes away.\nM: You know what? I think it isn't so bad to keep my feet off the ground for once.\nQuestion: How will the boy and the girl go to the ice cream shop?","x":"115"}],
["x115l21","聽力",2,"聽對話或短文，回答問題。",["They are happy about it.","They don't care about it.","They think differently about it."],0,"三個人都抱怨火車和車輛共用道路造成塞車，對火車改走地下很期待，都很高興。",{"au":"Welcome back, next on the news. Sunshine City has finally decided to move its trains underground. Let's listen to what people say about the new plan.\nM: You know the trains share the streets with all the cars and buses. The traffic is always terrible. Finally somebody's doing something about it.\nW: I have waited so long for this change. Every day when I drive to work, I need to stop many times for trains to pass. It takes me so much time to get to work.\nM: I think everyone will love it when the trains start running underground. Our driving time will be cut in half.\nQuestion: What do these three people think of Sunshine City's new plan?","x":"115"}]
